+# Repo Mirrors Health Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Add an API-backed repo Mirrors tab that lists mirror nodes, status, last seen, hosted since, sync age, and clone availability.
+
+**Architecture:** Keep mirror-health truth in the Worker by adding a small repo-scoped API that groups public catalog rows and joins live presence plus first-hosted data.
+The static website loads that endpoint lazily when the Mirrors tab opens and renders summary metrics plus a responsive table.
+The graph remains future work.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Python Cloudflare Worker, D1 tables already used by the Worker, vanilla HTML/CSS/JavaScript, pytest via `uvx pytest`.
+
+---
