+- Create `cloudflare_worker/tests/test_repo_mirrors.py` for helper-level Worker contract tests that do not import Workers-only JS modules.
+- Create `cloudflare_worker/tests/test_repo_mirrors_frontend.py` for static source-contract tests around the tab label, DOM ids, endpoint path, and responsive CSS hooks.
+- Modify `cloudflare_worker/public/index.html` to rename the tab and replace the placeholder panel with the Mirrors table shell.
+- Modify `cloudflare_worker/public/catalog.js` to lazy-load and render mirror health.
+- Modify `cloudflare_worker/public/styles.css` to style the summary metrics, table, state pills, and mobile row layout.
